# Skips CI accepts. Format: <package-regex> <test-regex> [qualifier...] # reason
# Patterns are anchored; the test pattern matches the top-level test name.
# Anything skipped that is not listed here fails the skipbudget gate
# (cmd/skipbudget). Add an entry only with a reason a reviewer can verify.
#
# Optional qualifiers narrow a rule (ci-02); a rule without them matches on
# every PostgreSQL major and with any skip text:
#   pg<N pg<=N pg>N pg>=N  the server majors the rule applies to; combine two
#                          for a range (pg>=16 pg<17). cmd/skipbudget then
#                          needs -pg <major>, and the same skip on any other
#                          major is UNLISTED.
#   reason=/regex/         the t.Skip text must match (unanchored). No spaces
#                          or '#' inside: write \s and \x23.
# A rule that matched no skip in a full run is reported STALE: fix or delete it.

